From: Eduardo Ruiz <335073+eduarbo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:19:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Stop paused videos too when their view hides

- A video under a menu is paused, not stopped, and hiding its view stopped
  only playing ones: a game started from a menu over a view (the save
  states over a game list) ran with that paused player still holding its
  outputs. A paused video whose view hides is now stopped, so the wait
  before a game covers it.
---
 es-core/src/components/VideoComponent.cpp | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/es-core/src/components/VideoComponent.cpp b/es-core/src/components/VideoComponent.cpp
index 5b171040..4e177fe8 100644
--- a/es-core/src/components/VideoComponent.cpp
+++ b/es-core/src/components/VideoComponent.cpp
@@ -560,6 +560,11 @@ void VideoComponent::manageState()
 			}
 		}
 	}
+	// A video paused under a menu whose view is hidden (a game starts from that menu) stops: a paused player
+	// keeps its sound and video outputs, and the wait before the game (Window::deinit) waits for it too
+	if (!show && !isShowing() && isPaused())
+		stopVideo();
+
 	// Need to recheck variable rather than 'else' because it may be modified above
 	if (!mIsPlaying)
 	{
